\f0\b Notes:
\f1\b0 \
- the files are provided as-is= some models might not be placed correctly (pivot at center bottom) or similar.\
\
- check the link above for which models share which material.\
\
- the textures have additional space for objects not shared here, potentially not part of the game. If you want maximum UV coverage, unwrap the model again with according to your needs and bake the texture to the new mapping or redo the texture.\
\
- some of the models don\'92t have a destroyed variant. Currently (initial release) there\'92s no support for destroyed variants if no destroyed object exists in the game.\
\
- check the online documentation at https://blindflugstudios.github.io/Ground-of-Aces-Docs/\
