\f0\b Presets:
\f1\b0 \

\f0\b Blender Export presets: 
\f1\b0 2 are provided, depending on how you set up your model in Blender (our models sadly have both...)\
If the model front faces away from you with it\'92s front, use the -Y Forward export preset\
If the model front faces you, use the Y Forward export preset\
\
The result should be that the front of the model is in the -Z direction in Ground of Aces (as all our objects should).\
\
Put these into your Blender Configuration file, /scripts/presets/operator/export_scene.fbx/\
\

\f0\b Substance Painter Export presets:
\f1\b0 \
Use the export presets depending on the textures you\'92re setting up. If you use Specular / Gloss in your maps, use the ones marked with Specular. If you use UDIM (not supported at the initial release), use the ones marked UDIM.\
\
Set up your file with the settings shown in the screenshots. Use the provided shader to preview your textures. It will not be the toon-shader like in GoA, but closer to the setup.\
\
There\'92s also materials provided, these are the ones we use when creating models, so you will get the same color / specular setup.\
\
Put these into your Substance Painter shelf directory.}